content.text:
Now bindGlobalInput changes. Add pointer lock listener, mouse look, fire button. Let's replace the block from `window.addEventListener('pointermove'..., onPointerMove)` maybe better targeted.

Current:
```
window.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => this.onPointerMove(e));
window.addEventListener('pointerup', (e) => this.onPointerUp(e));
window.addEventListener('pointercancel', (e) => this.onPointerUp(e));
document.querySelectorAll('#hud [data-action]')...
```
Add pointerlockchange after pointercancel. Add fire button binding after data-action loop. Let's patch.

